      "module": "lesen",
      "title": "Starting a New Hobby",
      "text": "Many people decide to take up a new hobby when they feel bored with their daily routine. It is a great way to meet new people (1) __________ share the same interests. Whether you choose painting, cooking, or learning a musical instrument, the most important thing is to enjoy the process. Some people prefer to join a club (2) __________ they can learn from an expert. Others prefer to teach (3) __________ by watching online videos. It does not matter (4) __________ you decide to do, as long as you stay motivated. You might find that you are not very good at the beginning, but (5) __________ is perfectly normal. Keep practicing, and you will soon see (6) __________ much you have improved.",
